@startuml sequence_publish_oneway
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Publish one-way (telemetry or event)

participant "App\n(publisher)" as App
participant "MessageBus" as Bus
participant "Pipeline\n(send)" as PipeS
queue "Redis\n(channel)" as Redis
participant "BusHostedService\n(subscriber)" as Host
participant "Pipeline\n(receive)" as PipeR
participant "IHandle<T>\n(scoped)" as H

App -> Bus : PublishAsync(msg)
Bus -> PipeS : log + validate
Bus -> Bus : envelope = wrap(msg)
Bus -> Redis : PUBLISH tel.* / evt.* envelope
Bus --> App : Task complete

Redis -> Host : message arrives
Host -> Host : deserialize envelope
Host -> PipeR : log + validate
PipeR -> H : HandleAsync(msg, ctx, ct)
H --> PipeR : done
note right of PipeR
  Handler exceptions are
  logged and swallowed.
  Other subscribers unaffected.
end note
@enduml
